EclipseReaper: {
	DisplayName: Hidden Sun Soulreaper
	Tooltip:
		'''
		Fires a rotating scythe that slowly deccelerates
		Hitting an enemy with the scythe directly will inflict max charged Madness for 4 seconds
		'''
