MushroomSoul: {
	DisplayName: Scarlet Soul Spore
	Tooltip: ""
	Lore:
		'''
		The Mushroom Monarch, a true ruler of mushrooms,
		he rules over the Scarlet Mycelium Forest, a small forest of red mushrooms.
		The monarch was once mindless, but he was granted a will when the glowing royalty
		shared his light.
		'''
}

GlowshroomSoul: {
	DisplayName: Indigo Soul Spore
	Tooltip: ""
	Lore:
		'''
		The Feudal Fungus, also known as Umos, the Radiant Apostle or glowing royalty is just like his brother and rules over a type of mushroom.
		He rules over the blue glowing mushrooms underground, but he has way more influence, 
		so his glow stretches all over the continent's caverns.
		This is unlike his brother, who only rules a small forest.
		He was mindless long ago, obeying distant orders, that was until it was blessed by light, claiming its new self.
		'''
	MemoryNotSeen:
		'''
		This soul reflecting spore contains a memory left there by its owner
		Use to view the memory
		The memory can only be witnessed once
		'''
	MemorySeen: No memories linger anymore
}

